					</li>
					<li Class="ArchivedDialog">
						<text>When a dark stranger offered you a cure for your cancer, you were ready to agree to anything. He made you into a sanguophage - an immortal blood-drinker hated by a thousand religions. You hid your condition for years, but a hunter eventually tracked you down. Stowing away on the first starship leaving the system, you barely escaped alive.

Then came the crash. Only a few made it to the escape pods. You land on an unknown rimworld and find that you are not alone. What will you do for the blood you need to survive?</text>
						<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
					</li>
					<li Class="StandardLetter">
						<def>PositiveEvent</def>
						<label>Persona bond: (*Name)Ethan(/Name)</label>
						<lookTargets>
							<targets>
								<li>Thing_Human782</li>
							</targets>
						</lookTargets>
						<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>911</arrivalTick>
						<text>(*Name)Ethan(/Name) has established a bond with the persona of Vixalxalar, persona monosword (&lt;color=#B183BD&gt;masterwork&lt;/color&gt;).

From now on, Vixalxalar, persona monosword (&lt;color=#B183BD&gt;masterwork&lt;/color&gt;) will refuse to be wielded by anyone except (*Name)Ethan(/Name).</text>
						<quest>null</quest>
						<hyperlinkThingDefs IsNull="True" />
						<hyperlinkHediffDefs IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li Class="StandardLetter">
						<ID>1</ID>
						<def>PositiveEvent</def>
						<label>New lovers</label>
						<lookTargets>
							<targets>
								<li>Thing_Human782</li>
								<li>Thing_Human717</li>
							</targets>
						</lookTargets>
						<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>1889</arrivalTick>
						<text>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ethan&lt;/color&gt; wooed &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Holmes&lt;/color&gt; by drawing attention to his own sense of responsibility. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Holmes&lt;/color&gt; responded well and is now &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ethan&lt;/color&gt;'s lover.</text>
						<quest>null</quest>
						<hyperlinkThingDefs IsNull="True" />
						<hyperlinkHediffDefs IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li Class="StandardLetter">
						<ID>2</ID>
						<def>PositiveEvent</def>
						<label>Fallen monolith</label>
						<lookTargets>
							<targets>
								<li>Thing_VoidMonolith38746</li>
							</targets>
						</lookTargets>
						<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>95942</arrivalTick>
						<text>(*Name)Ethan(/Name) has noticed an ancient monolith partly buried nearby.

If you investigate it, you could learn more.</text>
						<quest>null</quest>
						<hyperlinkThingDefs IsNull="True" />
						<hyperlinkHediffDefs IsNull="True" />
					</li>
