						<relatedFaction>Faction_0</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>150000</arrivalTick>
						<text>A teacher from (*Faction=Faction_0)Coalition of Funbo(/Faction) is visiting the colony.

He is named (*Name)Antonio 'Kraka' Landers(/Name).

He seems to have a few items to trade.</text>
						<quest>null</quest>
