						<arrivalTick>164204</arrivalTick>
						<text>Thanks to high mood, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Ethan&lt;/color&gt; has experienced an inspiration!

He will work faster for the next &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;8 days&lt;/color&gt;.</text>
