						<label>Gray pall</label>
						<lookTargets IsNull="True" />
						<relatedFaction>null</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>175681</arrivalTick>
						<text>A blanket of gritty fog has descended on this area. The fog smells ancient, somehow, and it stings the skin. The unnatural grayness of it invokes a sense of dread.</text>
