						<name>Unity Faith</name>
						<adjective>Vatoric</adjective>
						<memberName>Vatorist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Divine Templar</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Divine Templar</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>For an eternity, there was a world of green space, until &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Vator&lt;/color&gt; created the planets and stars. Though many adventurers moved against her, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Vator&lt;/color&gt; prevented them easily, for she was Goddess of Creation. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Vator&lt;/color&gt; said to all, "No one of you stands above the whole. Work together or perish together."</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>For an eternity, there was a world of green space, until %%deity0_name%% created the planets and stars. Though many adventurers moved against %%deity0_objective%%, %%deity0_name%% prevented them easily, for %%deity0_pronoun%% was %%deity0_type%%. %%Deity0_name%% said to all, "No one of you stands above the whole. Work together or perish together."</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
						<iconDef>TechLighthouse</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkPink</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.368, 0.318, 0.655, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_TheistEmbodied</li>
							<li>Collectivist</li>
						</memes>
