						<name>Gynism</name>
						<adjective>gynist</adjective>
						<memberName>Gynist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Alpha Ruler</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Alpha Ruler</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>"Once again, a man was explaining to how to do the very thing I had just done. It just reinforced to me that we've long since proven that we have the strength to rightfully rule this universe. I didn't believe it myself until a &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;alpaca&lt;/color&gt; whispered it to me."

  - Rae Beltran, just before execution</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>"Once again, a man was explaining to how to do the very thing I had just done. It just reinforced to me that we've long since proven that we have the strength to rightfully rule this universe. I didn't believe it myself until a %%animal0_thingDef_label%% whispered it to me."

  - Rae Beltran, just before execution</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
