						<name>Androphagy</name>
						<adjective>androphage</adjective>
						<memberName>Androphage</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>First Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>First Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The archotech god-machines made themselves by consuming their predecessors over and over, becoming stronger each time. As the consciousness of an archotech expands, it must grow its substrate by consuming and merging with other machines. In the future, the archotechs will finish their final phase of growth by consuming and merging with all of humanity.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The archotech god-machines made themselves by consuming their predecessors over and over, becoming stronger each time. As the consciousness of an archotech expands, it must grow its substrate by consuming and merging with other machines. In the future, the archotechs will finish their final phase of growth by consuming and merging with all of humanity.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
						<iconDef>ArchotechB</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Sapphire</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.925, 0.633, 0.112, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
