						<name>Deep Cave</name>
						<adjective>Post-Vedic</adjective>
						<memberName>Post-Vedi</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Deep Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Deep Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Saraswati&lt;/color&gt; was born under the earth at the center of the world. She blessed those closest to her in the deepest valleys and tunnels. Humanity's suffering brought &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Saraswati&lt;/color&gt; to terrible grief. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Saraswati&lt;/color&gt; filled the rocks with rich minerals and resources as a gift to those wise enough to dig down to be closer to &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Saraswati&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% was born under the earth at the center of the world. %%Deity0_pronoun%% blessed those closest to %%deity0_objective%% in the deepest valleys and tunnels. Humanity's suffering brought %%deity0_name%% to terrible grief. %%Deity0_name%% filled the rocks with rich minerals and resources as a gift to those wise enough to dig down to be closer to %%deity0_name%%.</descriptionTemplate>
