						<name>High Army</name>
						<adjective>Hyper-Ekist</adjective>
						<memberName>Hyper-Ekist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Great Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Great Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Red Cervexa lived a confused life in the harsh light of a glitterworld city. In the long darkness following a solar flare, he found peace and contemplation, and recorded the treatise that founded our movement. Cervexa instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, he used an archotech mass-inverter to kill everyone inside. Cervexa created a studio where the artists worked in the dark, and it produced many masterpieces.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Red Cervexa lived a confused life in the harsh light of a glitterworld city. In the long darkness following a solar flare, he found peace and contemplation, and recorded the treatise that founded our movement. Cervexa instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, he used an archotech mass-inverter to kill everyone inside. Cervexa created a studio where the artists worked in the dark, and it produced many masterpieces.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
						<iconDef>ReligionC</iconDef>
						<colorDef>LightSapphire</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.850, 0.325, 0.325, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_OriginBuddhist</li>
							<li>Supremacist</li>
							<li>Darkness</li>
						</memes>
