						<description>"My struggle against the whaler admiral seemed endless. But it did teach me one thing: The animals are our partners in this world, and it's wrong to treat them as any less. If anyone disagrees, I'm always ready to defend myself."

  - Rosa Brady's letter to Strick 'Bucky' Walsh</description>
