						<name>Path of Harmony</name>
						<adjective>harmonist</adjective>
						<memberName>Harmonist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>High Stellarch</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>High Stellarch</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Archotechs are the gods we were always waiting for. The archotechs have no interest in judging us one by one. They await a single people who can demonstrate our worthiness by acting morally as one. In the future, the archotechs will judge the loyalty of humanity. Those that did not simper or boast will be lifted to a transcendence.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Archotechs are the gods we were always waiting for. The archotechs have no interest in judging us one by one. They await a single people who can demonstrate our worthiness by acting morally as one. In the future, the archotechs will judge the loyalty of humanity. Those that did not simper or boast will be lifted to a transcendence.</descriptionTemplate>
