						<name>Chelisi Ship</name>
						<adjective>manist</adjective>
						<memberName>Manist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Holy Bishop</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Holy Bishop</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Anorus&lt;/color&gt; gave strength to men, that they may protect and maintain the weak women and children, and admonished those who upset this divine order. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Anorus&lt;/color&gt; dispersed the great people of Chelis, sending them into the void so that they may witness the convergence of star and soul. Though many adventurers moved against him, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Anorus&lt;/color&gt; prevented them easily, for he was Master of Creation.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% gave strength to men, that they may protect and maintain the weak women and children, and admonished those who upset this divine order. %%Deity0_name%% dispersed the great people of Chelis, sending them into the void so that they may witness the convergence of star and soul. Though many adventurers moved against %%deity0_objective%%, %%deity0_name%% prevented them easily, for %%deity0_pronoun%% was %%deity0_type%%.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
						<iconDef>CirclesA</iconDef>
						<colorDef>LightGreen</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.570, 0.470, 0.290, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_TheistAbstract</li>
							<li>MaleSupremacy</li>
							<li>Shipborn</li>
						</memes>
