						<memberName>Archotechnist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Shining Pilot</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Shining Pilot</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Since their emergence, archotechs have extended their consciousness amongst the stars. Archotechs are good and the most important task for humanity is to understand them so we can align with their understanding. Some day, archotechs will teach us to move effortlessly amongst the stars if we observe their cosmic wisdom.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Since their emergence, archotechs have extended their consciousness amongst the stars. Archotechs are good and the most important task for humanity is to understand them so we can align with their understanding. Some day, archotechs will teach us to move effortlessly amongst the stars if we observe their cosmic wisdom.</descriptionTemplate>
